:: Stay {"position":"800,475","size":"100,100"}
You:
“Let’s just stay.”
-
You set down the blanket on the lawn. In unspoken agreement, you and your friends eat your food as quickly as possible. 
-
You:
(This lawn is really nice. I wish I could’ve enjoyed it more.)
-
Beverly takes out her phone. 
-
Beverly
“Oh, this explains things. Look, there is a landfill really close to here.” 
-
You look at her phone and sigh. 
-
You
(Was it even worth it to stay?)
-

